    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper to keep track of a condition and if it should be treated as negated for reproducer construction. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pred == Predicate::BAD_ICMP_PREDICATE indicates that this entry is a placeholder to keep the ReproducerCondStack in sync with DFSInStack. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
